    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d354">

                <pb facs="0876" n="836" sameAs="frus:frus1952-54v09p1/pg836"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">886A.2553/7–2054: Telegram</note>
                <head>No. 354<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Embassy in
                        Saudi Arabia</hi><anchor n="1" xml:id="d354-f1"/></head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left"><hi rendition="#small-caps">secret</hi>
                        <lb/>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">priority</hi></seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1954-07-21T19:23:00-04:00">July 21, 1954—7:23
                        p.m.</date></dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>20. Embtel 32.<anchor n="2" xml:id="d354-f2"/> Agree desirability synchronizing
                    approach with Aramco and considering nuances with Davies and Owen. Department’s
                    sense of urgency based on parent Companies’ fear Onassis request for cargo
                    possible any day. Would expect request at least thirty days before tanker
                    available for cargo and believe Onassis has tankers available send Damman any
                    time.</p>
                <p>Believe Department’s instructions re representations in keeping present position
                    held Aramco and parent company officials here. No objection in principle to
                    certain Saudi tanker fleet or to Agreement if stripped objectionable features.
                    Some incentive such as companies willingness cooperate Saudi fleet operated
                    basis competitive rates and without monopolistic features may be necessary.…</p>
                <p>You authorized submit draft <hi rendition="#italic">aide-mémoire</hi> Department
                    for comment and then discuss with Faisal. However Department uncertain his
                    sympathy re our position.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Dulles</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d354-f1" n="1" type="source" xml:id="d354-f1-content">
                <p>Drafted by Dorsey and Gay and cleared by PED, TRC, NEA and NE, and G, in
                    substance.</p>
            </note>
